# ── GAME DATA — never, under any circumstances ───────────────────────────────────────
# This repository ships no Wasteland content. data/ is produced on each user's machine by
# bootstrap.py from their own disk images, and must never be committed. The patterns below
# are deliberately broader than data/: a stray .g64 or a decoded .bin anywhere in the tree
# is a mistake, and tools/check_clean.py fails the build if one is ever staged.
data/
data_a2/
*.g64
*.d64
*.d81
*.t64
*.tap
*.dsk
*.po
*.nib
*.2mg
*.woz
*.crt
*.prg
*.bin
*.wlsave
names.json

# ── ordinary noise ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.env
*.log
.DS_Store
._*
